[node name="Page" parent="StoryPlaces/Lake/IslePage/After"]
page = 10
text = "My dear grandchild, if you are reading this, the light is shining again, and you did it. The Moonwell was never really magic. It was always us: caring for this place, and for each other. The island is yours now. Look after it, and let it look after you. With all my love, Grandpa Elias."

